.TH AVR\-SETTINGS\-SCHEMA 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-settings-schema \- List available setting definitions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr settings schema
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List available setting definitions.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr settings schema
    avr settings schema --prefix cache. --scope repository
    avr settings schema --json '*'
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    choices, default, description, inherits, key, max_value, min_value,
    scopes, value_type
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by key prefix (e.g. 'cache.').
.TP
\fB\-\-scope\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Filter by scope. (choices: repository, organization)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-settings (1),
.BR avr-settings-list (1),
.BR avr-settings-reset (1),
.BR avr-settings-set (1)
